# The app validates every required variable at startup and refuses to boot without them, so this file
# holds format-valid placeholders plus the local database stand-in's key. Compose lists this file
# FIRST and /run/base44/app.env last, so any real value stored in the dashboard overrides it.
#
# SUPABASE_URL / SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY: the local PostgREST gateway and a key signed with the
# JWT secret in docker-compose.base44.yml. A real Supabase project's values override them.
